              // fatal for a "paste multi-line text" propose action (confirmed live, Move 3 G4,
              // docs/MOVE3_AGGREGATE_WORKBENCH_PLAN.md: a pasted CSV became one line, so the parser's
              // own header-row skip consumed the entire payload and returned zero data rows). A
              // <textarea> preserves newlines and degrades fine for a short single-line value too.
